<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
    <meta name="theme-color" content="#f4f2e9">
    <meta name="description" content="Create a TenderLens account for a bidder profile and saved tender links across devices.">
    <meta name="tenderlens-api" content="">
    <title>Create account — TenderLens</title>
    <link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="favicon.svg">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="styles.css">
    <script src="theme.js"></script>
    <script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@supabase/supabase-js@2.118.0" defer></script>
    <script src="auth.js" defer></script>
    <script src="app.js" defer></script>
  </head>
  <body class="account-page">
    <a class="skip-link" href="#main">Skip to content</a>
    <header class="site-header"><div class="container nav-shell"><a class="brand" href="index.html" aria-label="TenderLens home"><span class="brand-mark" aria-hidden="true">⌕</span><span class="brand-name">Tender<span>Lens</span></span></a><div class="header-actions"><button class="theme-toggle" id="theme-toggle" type="button" aria-label="Switch theme" aria-pressed="false"><span class="theme-toggle-icon" aria-hidden="true">☾</span><span id="theme-toggle-label">Dark mode</span></button><a class="header-account-link" data-auth-signin href="signin.html">Sign in</a></div></div></header>
    <main class="auth-main" id="main">
      <div class="auth-orbit auth-orbit-one" aria-hidden="true"></div><div class="auth-orbit auth-orbit-two" aria-hidden="true"></div>
      <section class="auth-layout auth-layout-signup" aria-labelledby="auth-title">
        <div class="auth-story"><p class="eyebrow"><span class="eyebrow-mark"></span> START YOUR WORKSPACE</p><h1>Keep the details you need, <em>close at hand.</em></h1><p>Create your account to sync a short bidder profile and save genuine live tender notices for later.</p><div class="auth-benefits"><span>✓ Profile available across devices</span><span>✓ Official notice links in one place</span><span>✓ Sample data stays in the browser</span></div></div>
        <div class="auth-card">
          <p class="eyebrow">CREATE YOUR ACCOUNT</p><h2 id="auth-title">A clearer place to start</h2><p class="auth-intro">Use an email and password, or sign up with Google.</p>
          <button class="google-button" type="button" data-google-signin><span class="google-mark" aria-hidden="true">G</span> Sign up with Google</button>
          <div class="auth-divider"><span>or use email</span></div>
          <form class="auth-form" data-signup-form>
            <label class="profile-field" for="signup-name">Your name<input id="signup-name" name="full_name" type="text" autocomplete="name" maxlength="100" required placeholder="Name"></label>
            <label class="profile-field" for="signup-email">Work email<input id="signup-email" name="email" type="email" autocomplete="email" required placeholder="you@company.com"></label>
            <label class="profile-field" for="signup-password">Create a password<input id="signup-password" name="password" type="password" autocomplete="new-password" minlength="8" required placeholder="At least 8 characters"></label>
            <label class="profile-field" for="signup-password-confirm">Confirm password<input id="signup-password-confirm" name="password_confirm" type="password" autocomplete="new-password" minlength="8" required placeholder="Type it again"></label>
            <button class="auth-submit" data-auth-submit type="submit">Create account <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></button>
            <p class="auth-status" data-auth-status role="status" aria-live="polite"></p>
          </form>
          <p class="auth-terms">By creating an account, you agree to the <a href="terms.html">Terms &amp; conditions</a> and acknowledge the <a href="privacy.html">Privacy notice</a>.</p>
          <p class="auth-switch">Already have an account? <a href="signin.html">Sign in</a></p>
          <p class="auth-config-hint" data-auth-config-needed hidden>Local setup is needed before registration can work. <a href="guide.html#account-setup">See account setup</a>.</p>
        </div>
      </section>
    </main>
    <footer class="auth-footer"><a href="index.html">← Back to TenderLens</a><span><a href="privacy.html">Privacy</a><a href="terms.html">Terms</a></span></footer>
