            <details><summary>Are the tenders and results real?</summary><p>No. Tender names, buyers, dates, amounts and report findings on this page are made-up examples.</p></details>
            <details><summary>Can I check if my company qualifies?</summary><p>Not yet. The checklist is only a local demo. This website does not accept company files or run a real eligibility review.</p></details>
